✅ **All 35 tests pass** (18 new tests + 17 existing tests)
- Cycle detection tests
- File reads/writes tests
- Plan/snapshot tests
- Existing order, show, and digest functionality tests

The implementation only modified the `order` function body and kept all other files and exports unchanged, as required.

